+++ b/packages/coding-agent/docs/acp.md
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# Native ACP mode
+
+Run `bangboo acp` to expose Bangboo over ACP JSONL on stdin/stdout.
+
+For bb, use provider ID `acp-bangboo` and this exact configuration:
+
+```json
+{
+  "customAcpAgents": [
+    {
+      "id": "bangboo",
+      "displayName": "Bangboo",
+      "command": "bangboo",
+      "args": ["acp"]
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+Use an absolute `command` path when bb's host daemon PATH cannot resolve Bangboo.
+
+ACP state, sessions, and saved project trust live under `~/.bangboo/agent`. Model and thinking-level selection, cancellation, client tool-permission requests, and text/image prompts are supported. Session fork, rename, archive, auto mode, and RPC UI are unsupported. Requests with non-empty MCP server lists are rejected.
+
+Extensions are trusted code running with the user's permissions. ACP tool permissions do not sandbox extensions; review installed extensions before starting ACP mode.
